      "text": "Frequency once per day\n\n---\n\nEffect Vizmivool attempts a dagger Strike against an ally and shifts the result of this Strike up by one degree of success. If the Strike kills the ally, the sacrificed ally's life force flows like red fire out of the wound and into Vizmivool's body, healing her for 10d6 healing Hit Points and making her Quickened for 1 minute. She can use the additional action to Strike or Stride.",
